{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-02-15 16:15:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK SELECTS DERRIC HICKS TO LEAD SOUTH DALLAS BUSINESS BANKING TEAM', 'text': 'DALLAS, FEB. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COMERICA INCORPORATED ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT DERRIC HICKS HAS BEEN NAMED THE GROUP MANAGER FOR ITS NEW SOUTH DALLAS BUSINESS BANKING TEAM. HE WILL REPORT TO DALLAS MARKET PRESIDENT AMANDA MAHANEY.'}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-02-15 09:15:00', 'title': 'COMERICA EARNS PERFECT SCORE ON CORPORATE EQUALITY INDEX FOR EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "DALLAS, FEB. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HUMAN RIGHTS CAMPAIGN FOUNDATION HAS RECOGNIZED COMERICA FOR ITS COMMITMENT TO FOSTERING A DIVERSE AND INCLUSIVE WORK ENVIRONMENT FOR THE EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR AFTER RECEIVING A PERFECT 100 PERCENT ON ITS CORPORATE EQUALITY INDEX (CEI). THE CEI IS THE NATION'S FOREMOST BENCHMARKING SURVEY AND REPORT MEASURING COMPANY POLICIES AND PRACTICES RELATED TO LGBTQ+ WORKPLACE EQUALITY."}